Subject: [PATCH] tools: replace local C:/ArifiLabs paths with repo-relative
 ones in hand-written tools (HQ84 item 9)

arifi-sync: STUDIO_ROOT = ARIFI_STUDIO_ROOT, else the nearest ancestor holding registers/ + research/, else "" (public clone);
judge.model may be studio-relative; recipe diff compares values under the repo root as repo-relative, so the committed
snapshot's FETCHCONTENT_BASE_DIR no longer pins a checkout. protected-wins.json, the baseline authority and sources.json
carry studio-relative locators. lane-296 scripts take STUDIO_ROOT (required) and MINGW_BIN (optional).
kv-mean-center ab-proof.py uses the same root finder; READMEs (kv-mean-center, moe-disk-probe) drop the local paths.
patches/series and evidence receipts untouched (generated / sha-pinned).

Origin: lane-298
Measured-effect: none (path handling only; proof cells/scrub-proof-*.txt: validate/check/series PASS in both root modes, every locator resolves)
